      {
        "does": "With the red selector lever in position 1, the knob on top of the frame (a black axle joiner on a vertical shaft) tips the bed at the back: a 20 tooth bevel gear at the shaft's foot turns the selector shaft through a 12 tooth bevel gear, the driving ring couples one clutch gear, and through a 16 tooth idler, a shaft and two universal joints it runs the linear actuator that lifts the bed.",
        "mechanisms": [
          "function-selector",
          "linear-actuator: bed"
