        "source": "book 1: steps 5-18 (the selector's shaft, clutch gears, driving ring and lever, pages 4-14; the 1:1 drawing on page 13), steps 54-57 (bed and actuator; step 57 on page 61 draws the knob, the lever and the bed tipping); book 2 pages 67-68 and 76 (the lever's two positions: 1 tips the bed)",
